    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d820">

                <pb facs="0967" n="873" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg873"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Vali of Aleppo refused to permit 20 Armenian students to go from Marash to Tarsus
                    Institute for education. Have secured orders from Grand Vizier permitting them
                    to go.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
